+### Configuration (Router)
+
+Swarm sends every request to [Router](https://api.router.com/v1) through the OpenAI Responses API
+(`POST /v1/responses`). Router holds the provider credentials, so no provider API key is needed.
+
+```shell
+export RAMP_ROUTER_API_KEY=...        # Router API key
+export ROUTER_MODEL=<router-model-id> # a model ID returned by GET https://api.router.com/v1/models
+```
+
+`ROUTER_EVAL_MODEL` optionally overrides the model used by the example LLM-judge evals.
+
